      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought these would be pull metrics though ?\n\nAlso, are we concerned that pulling every 24h with base of \"latest boot\" is going to skew the metrics because devices\n- don\u0027t boot at the same time\n- don\u0027t boot at uniform times throughout the day",
      "revId": "d8d8f02f4fc28135abc69432466af781a8ba25bb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "db1c711b_71457c3b",
