      "writtenOn": "2023-06-09T08:14:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is it important to have the push be uniform across time? As long as it has been 24h, it is a good data point? \n\nIf we do want to do analysis where the push time is uniform across time, it should be possible to achieve that by just sampling the data ?",
      "parentUuid": "70775e8a_1bb1d57f",
      "revId": "d8d8f02f4fc28135abc69432466af781a8ba25bb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
